---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Privacy Policy | PluginDrop" description="How PluginDrop collects, uses, and protects your data, including analytics, cookies, newsletter signup, and advertising." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<a href="#main-content" class="sr-only">Skip to content</a>
		<Header />
		<main id="main-content">
			<div class="about">
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p><em>Last updated: August 23, 2026</em></p>

				<p>
					PluginDrop ("we", "us") is operated by <strong>SignalDrop</strong>. This page explains
					what information we collect when you visit plugindrop.net, how we use it, and the
					choices you have. If you have questions, contact us at
					<a href="mailto:signaldrop.biz@gmail.com">signaldrop.biz@gmail.com</a>.
				</p>

				<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Analytics data:</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 to see which pages are
						visited, how long people stay, approximate location (derived from IP address), and
						device/browser type. We do not use this to identify you personally.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Newsletter signup:</strong> If you subscribe to price-drop alerts, we collect
						your email address and any interest categories you select (e.g. synths, mixing). This
						is processed through <strong>Resend</strong> to send you emails. You can unsubscribe
						at any time via the link in every email.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>On-device personalization:</strong> Some sections of the site (deals, article
						lists) may be reordered based on what you've read. This reading profile is stored only
						in your browser's <code>localStorage</code> — it never reaches our servers. You can
						clear it with the "reset" control next to any "Sorted for you" label.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
				<p>
					Google Analytics sets cookies to distinguish visitors and sessions. We are also in the
					process of applying for <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. If and when ads are enabled,
					Google and its advertising partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to
					this site and other sites on the internet. You can review or opt out of personalized
					advertising at Google's
					<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ad Settings</a>,
					and learn more about how Google uses data from partner sites at
					<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
					Other third-party advertising vendors may also let you opt out via
					<a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
				</p>
				<p>
					Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings. Blocking cookies may
					affect how some parts of the site work.
				</p>

				<h2>Third-Party Services We Use</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> — traffic and usage analytics</li>
					<li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising (pending approval)</li>
					<li><strong>Resend</strong> — newsletter delivery</li>
					<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> — website hosting</li>
					<li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — CDN, DNS, and security (proxy)</li>
					<li><strong>Affiliate networks</strong> (e.g. Plugin Boutique, FlexOffers) — track purchases made through our affiliate links so we can earn a commission</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					Each of these providers has its own privacy policy governing how they handle data. We
					only share what's necessary for them to provide their service to us (e.g. your email
					address with Resend if you subscribe).
				</p>

				<h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
				<p>
					Some links on this site are affiliate links — we may earn a commission if you make a
					purchase, at no extra cost to you. Our deal scoring and recommendations are not
					influenced by commission rates. See our <a href="/about">About page</a> for the full
					editorial policy.
				</p>

				<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
				<p>
					PluginDrop is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
					personal information from children under 13.
				</p>

				<h2>Your Choices and Rights</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Unsubscribe from emails at any time using the link in every newsletter.</li>
					<li>Control or delete cookies through your browser settings.</li>
					<li>Opt out of personalized ads via Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ad Settings</a>.</li>
					<li>Request access to or deletion of any personal data we hold (e.g. your newsletter email) by contacting <a href="mailto:signaldrop.biz@gmail.com">signaldrop.biz@gmail.com</a>.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Data Retention</h2>
				<p>
					We keep newsletter subscriber data for as long as you remain subscribed. Analytics data
					is retained according to Google Analytics' standard retention settings. On-device
					personalization data stays in your browser until you clear it or your browser storage is
					cleared.
				</p>

				<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
				<p>
					We may update this policy as the site evolves (for example, once Google AdSense is
					approved). Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above.
				</p>

				<h2>Contact</h2>
				<p>
					Questions about this policy or your data? Reach us at
					<a href="mailto:signaldrop.biz@gmail.com">signaldrop.biz@gmail.com</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about {
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 1rem;
	}
	.about h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.about p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.about strong {
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}
	.about h2 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.about ul {
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}
	.about li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
